# .github/moodle-ci/phpcs-maxwarnings-dist
#
# Copy this file to .github/moodle-ci/phpcs-maxwarnings (drop the "-dist"
# suffix) to override the --max-warnings value used by the "Moodle Code
# Checker" (phpcs) step in CI.
#
# Format: a single integer on its own line. Blank lines and lines starting
# with "#" are ignored, so this header can stay in place.
#
# If the file does not exist, or its value isn't a valid integer, CI falls
# back to the strict default of --max-warnings 0 (any PHPCS warning fails
# the build).
#
# Uncomment ONE of the examples below (or use your own value):

# Strict (default behaviour, equivalent to not having this file at all):
# 0

# Allow up to 10 warnings before the build fails:
# 10

# Don't fail the build on warnings at all (errors still fail it):
# -1
